// luminaria_backend: where pixels go and input comes from. DRM/KMS (atomic
// commits, planes and their formats, page flips, hotplug), a nested Wayland
// backend and a headless one; seat sessions through libseat, input devices
// through libinput, keymaps through xkbcommon. Frames are requested, never
// polled: an idle output costs no wakeups.
